# Null Summoner's threshold ability is an ability of the permanent, so while it has lost all its abilities (CR 613.1f) it lets
# nothing be cast. Bot1 exiles Bot2's Lightning Bolt and mills itself to threshold. On turn two Bot2 casts Dress Down ("creatures
# lose all abilities"): with Mox Pearl open Bot1 can't cast the Bolt from exile. At the beginning of the end step Dress Down is
# sacrificed, the Summoner has its abilities again (CR 611.3a), and Bot1 casts the instant in that end step with the Pearl's {W}
# (CR 609.4b), hitting Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Null Summoner
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Brain Freeze
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Dress Down
Mox Sapphire
Island x30

[Actions]
